  "description": "Add the irresistible flavors of peanut butter and chocolate to weekday snacks and lunches with a new, Walmart-exclusive variety of Smucker’s Uncrustables frozen sandwiches. This box contains ten individually wrapped frozen sandwiches, with zero prep required. Keep them in your fridge for up to five days so they’re thawed and ready to eat at a moment’s notice. Or, store them in the freezer for longer and thaw whenever you’re ready. Each one is filled with a combo of creamy peanut butter and a smooth chocolate flavored spread. The outside is Unbeatably Soft Bread Baked Fresh in the USA to make every bite feel just right. But maybe the coolest part about Uncrustables Peanut Butter &amp; Chocolate Flavored Spread sandwiches is that they deliver great flavor with no high fructose corn syrup and no artificial colors or dyes. These crustless sandwiches are super-convenient snacks and lunch foods you can count on to make your day a little easier (and tastier). Try ’em all!",
